## SQ-RC-01 | Arc Furnace gilding takes the food + 4 gold (golden carrot, golden apple, a Golden Food food)
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail golden_carrot_arc_gilding`; `/cdevtest rdetail golden_apple_arc_gilding`; `/cdevtest rdetail golden_melon_slice_arc_gilding`; `/cdevtest bytype immersiveengineering:arc_furnace max=400`
@pass each recipe present (`serializer=immersiveengineering:arc_furnace`); its ingredients are the food and 4 gold entries (nuggets for the carrot and melon slice, ingots for the apple), not 5; about 25 `_arc_gilding` ids in the bytype list
@fails `cd_food.js` `gold.arc` (should be 4); `goldenGild` loop; IE arc recipe ingredient order
@reviewed 2026-11-26
> cdevtest rdetail golden_carrot_arc_gilding
> cdevtest rdetail golden_apple_arc_gilding
> cdevtest rdetail golden_melon_slice_arc_gilding
> cdevtest bytype immersiveengineering:arc_furnace max=400
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*golden_carrot_arc_gilding serializer=immersiveengineering:arc_furnace result=minecraft:golden_carrot\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*golden_apple_arc_gilding serializer=immersiveengineering:arc_furnace result=minecraft:golden_apple\*1
expect verb=rdetail id=\S*golden_melon_slice_arc_gilding serializer=immersiveengineering:arc_furnace result=\S+\*1
count verb=bytype id=\S+_arc_gilding result= >= 20
shell grep -qE "^\s*gold: \{ mixer: 6, arc: 4 \}," "$INST/development/creativeDelight/src/main/resources/kubejs_startup/creativedelight/cd_food.js"
look r1126q writer-5: `rdetail` prints `ingredients=-` for IE arc furnace recipes (the additives are not read; r1120nv), so the 4-gold count is checked at its source (the `gold.arc` value the recipe loop adds from, shell step above); a live read of the additives needs a Devtools verb

## SQ-RC-02 | mason jar and glass bottle crafts give 4; vanilla glass bottle recipe gone
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest makes vintagedelight:empty_mason_jar`; `/cdevtest makes minecraft:glass_bottle`; `/cdevtest recipes minecraft:glass_bottle`
@pass a crafting recipe makes `vintagedelight:empty_mason_jar*4`; `creativedelight:shaped/glass_bottle` makes `minecraft:glass_bottle*4`; `minecraft:glass_bottle` (vanilla id) is absent
@fails vintage member `mason_jar.json` not rebuilt; `minecraft/recipes.js` removal or shaped call
> cdevtest makes vintagedelight:empty_mason_jar
> cdevtest makes minecraft:glass_bottle
> cdevtest recipes minecraft:glass_bottle
expect verb=makes id=\S+ result=vintagedelight:empty_mason_jar\*4 serializer=minecraft:crafting_shaped
expect verb=makes id=creativedelight:shaped/glass_bottle result=minecraft:glass_bottle\*4
reject verb=(makes|recipes) id=minecraft:glass_bottle
reject verb=makes id=\S+ result=(minecraft:glass_bottle|vintagedelight:empty_mason_jar)\*3 serializer=minecraft:crafting
look one shaped mason jar recipe giving 4; one shaped glass bottle recipe giving 4 under the creativedelight id

## SQ-RC-03 | banana bunch on the cutting board gives 6 bananas
@group A
@commands `/cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/banana_bunch`
@pass `creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/banana_bunch` (recipe dump 2026-11-19; the type prefix was `fdcutting/` before the 2026-11-17 forPack binding), Farmer's Delight cutting, ingredient `neapolitan:banana_bunch`, a knife tool, result 6 `neapolitan:banana`
@fails `R.fdCutting` in CD `neapolitan/recipes.js`; `i.banana_bunch` key
> cdevtest rdetail creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/banana_bunch
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/banana_bunch serializer=farmersdelight:cutting
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:farmersdelightcutting/banana_bunch .*ingredients=neapolitan:banana_bunch
look result 6 neapolitan:banana (cutting results show as rolled part=results lines)
